-- Byte-identical in shape to main.mdk/lib.mdk except r1 and r2 carry explicit `Int ->
-- Int` signatures (control_lib.mdk), so the group is monomorphic from the start instead
-- of being generalized over `Num a` and instantiated at the call site. MEASURED:
-- check/run/build all exit 0 and the executed binary exits 0 printing 6.
import control_lib.{r1}

main = println (r1 (3 : Int))
